            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.8 — Snappier</h3>
<ul>
<li>Tabs you're not looking at now rest, like in Safari, so the tab you're on gets the whole machine — smoother scrolling, less battery. Switching back is still instant.</li>
<li>Pages show up sooner: Pane now knows the moment a page first draws instead of checking for it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
