            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.6 — Save As</h3>
<ul>
<li>Right-click a video, image or link to Save Video As…, Save Image As… or Save Link As…, or anywhere on a page to Save Page As….</li>
<li>Videos that sites stream in pieces (like YouTube) can't be saved as a file — Pane tells you instead of failing quietly.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
